:: MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Park")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Park">>
<</if>>
你将采自温室与深林月泉的三株双生银丝花标本放入蒸馏铜釜，萃取出了一瓶散发幽香的雾月秘露。饮下秘露后，一股温润清冽的气息流遍全身，你的心神与控制力焕然一新。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_bride_flower")>>
	<<set $mpCollectHubUnlocked to ($mpCollectHubUnlocked or 0) + 1>>
	<<set $money += 180000>>
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 2>>
	<<willpower 6>><<stress -15>><<trauma -8>><<control 20>>
<<else>>
	<<money 25000>><<stress -6>>
<</if>>
